usage: coordinate_source030.py [-h] --run-root RUN_ROOT
                               [--runtime-script RUNTIME_SCRIPT] [--apply]

Once-only, external source029 normal-speed-end -> source030 coordinator. No
SSH, simulation, polling scheduler, kill or signal API. The already frozen
controller owns its explicit seven-day wait and exact supervisor-only signals.
Failures preserve evidence and never retry. Default is read-only; --apply is
required to start the future controller and subsequent native deployment CLI.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --run-root RUN_ROOT   actual experiment, not experiment/train
  --runtime-script RUNTIME_SCRIPT
  --apply               start exactly one bounded future
                        controller/prepare/launch sequence
